This project is a synthetic multi-module Maven reactor whose tests do nothing but
sleep for fixed, deterministic durations. It exists to measure and illustrate
Maven build performance — reactor parallelism (-T), the Takari smart builder's
critical-path scheduling, and Surefire's intra-module fork parallelism — using
build profiles produced by the mvn-lens JFR build profiler.

